  "author_name": "daniloceano",
  "body": "Packaging fixes: cmocean>=4.0.3, install_requires reduced to the six imported\nlibraries, sdist without tests/; app requirement floors; app_test CI job and\npublication gated on it. cyclophaser/ unchanged from 2.1.2. Merges develop at\n0dcc57a, green in pipeline 428. Authorized by Danilo (AUTORIZA\u00c7\u00c3O 2).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
